<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.49 pct, 3-mo 21.26 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.49 pct, 3-mo 21.26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) remained steady for the one-month maturity and eased for three-month maturity, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 21.49 percent, while the three-month rate eased to 21.26 percent, down 0.03, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
